== 5.3 The Regimes, in Order

The examinable spine of the chapter is the sequence. Learn it as five blocks rather than as
ten names: *Ironsi* (January to July 1966), *Gowon* (1966 to 1975, including the civil
war), *Murtala and Obasanjo* (1975 to 1979, ending in the handover), *Buhari and Babangida*
(1983 to 1993, ending in the annulled election), and *Shonekan, Abacha and Abubakar* (1993
to 1999, ending in the handover).

